=== layout: one-panel

# *Summary*

@body

- [*Paracentric Inversion*]{color=red} &#8211; results in one dicentric chromosome and one acentric chromosome
- [*Pericentric Inversion*]{color=red} &#8211; results in two monocentric chromosomes with deletions and duplications of genes

